{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651310/extras/c37624792d31aa30c99141740d61bf36.poster.avif?t=1772473596\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651310/extras/c37624792d31aa30c99141740d61bf36.webm?t=1772473596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651310/extras/c37624792d31aa30c99141740d61bf36.mp4?t=1772473596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong><i>little corners</i></strong>, we\u2019ve tried to capture the magic and satisfaction of sticker books. You\u2019ll be able to build endless tiny worlds from the ground up using just your imagination, and thousands of stickers. We hope you enjoy peeling, placing and discovering all our little game has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651310/extras/8940862638080ff2a5c9ce5c325a1795.avif?t=1772473596\" width=1170 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin with a blank space and let your creativity bloom as you bring these corners to life. Chill out to lofi beats as you satisfyingly place furniture, trinkets and fluffy animals around the room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651310/extras/4a5f37318b7a2378331497869a88274b.avif?t=1772473596\" width=1170 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover 8 little corners of fantastical worlds to get lost in, including a boisterous adventurer\u2019s tavern, a mystical alchemist\u2019s tower and the quarters of a ruthless sea captain. Each room features hidden stickers for you to discover, try some different combinations, who knows what you might find?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651310/extras/8109eaea039ac0f4858589b1d1bc5bb5.avif?t=1772473596\" width=1170 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve included a range of customisation options including cursor size and transparency, audio settings and you can even customise your workspace with a range of backgrounds and mats. Once you\u2019re happy with your design, use the in-game screenshot feature to share your creations with the community and get inspired for your next creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651310/extras/ebe5e1064d2eb1de3c85c81a1c9d3af0.poster.avif?t=1772473596\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651310/extras/ebe5e1064d2eb1de3c85c81a1c9d3af0.webm?t=1772473596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Happy Mouse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3651310/e9b44234440a481735f2b9a59d7ff9edbf7aca0c.jpg"},{"name":"Lit Fireplace","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3651310/add8d938e55959e1c24ed6ec31dd0e8c31fa557d.jpg"},{"name":"Poison Bottle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3651310/17c8018780de80df4c87b2660fbc7e37ffdb374c.jpg"},{"name":"Calculated Chalkboard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3651310/d835a7d1b96d7ac16be9bd4d112d5d75ecf73c33.jpg"},{"name":"Stargazer ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3651310/e41f08ff1383120e6c31d7c9a1d4c97b57c49bbc.jpg"},{"name":"Big Stretch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3651310/52736a0e3710ec869ecaa2527adaa5c76d267739.jpg"},{"name":"Happy Dog","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3651310/e6d2d78d65f0bc2240defa498598678138eac2ca.jpg"},{"name":"Dragon Trophy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3651310/23b367463162930d98d2973c2f6e5a8a88daf488.jpg"},{"name":"Quest Board","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3651310/a33cf5fdcb79d6f39fc69be9aa5788d0b25bbb7d.jpg"},{"name":"Fan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3651310/69109e692fb983290c35c65d16fab0f009e14be0.jpg"}],"total":45},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3651310?t=1772473596","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651310/7bdcc0f564da65e362294ced40d23dfbe49997f6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772473596","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651310/90226b451a039a7c3a4dfb1293d340f2a997ac16/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772473596","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651310/90226b451a039a7c3a4dfb1293d340f2a997ac16/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772473596","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3892990,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Share your creations!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651310/extras/6650a9205aedaaee98d4745904fe931f.avif?t=1772473596\" width=1170 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did you know that Little Corners has an official Discord group where players can discuss the game, share their creations, and get involved in steering the future of development? You can find the link to join on the right-hand side of our Store Page, alongside links to our socials.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651310/extras/c37624792d31aa30c99141740d61bf36.poster.avif?t=1772473596\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651310/extras/c37624792d31aa30c99141740d61bf36.webm?t=1772473596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651310/extras/c37624792d31aa30c99141740d61bf36.mp4?t=1772473596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong><i>little corners</i></strong>, we\u2019ve tried to capture the magic and satisfaction of sticker books. You\u2019ll be able to build endless tiny worlds from the ground up using just your imagination, and thousands of stickers. We hope you enjoy peeling, placing and discovering all our little game has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651310/extras/8940862638080ff2a5c9ce5c325a1795.avif?t=1772473596\" width=1170 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin with a blank space and let your creativity bloom as you bring these corners to life. Chill out to lofi beats as you satisfyingly place furniture, trinkets and fluffy animals around the room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651310/extras/4a5f37318b7a2378331497869a88274b.avif?t=1772473596\" width=1170 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover 8 little corners of fantastical worlds to get lost in, including a boisterous adventurer\u2019s tavern, a mystical alchemist\u2019s tower and the quarters of a ruthless sea captain. Each room features hidden stickers for you to discover, try some different combinations, who knows what you might find?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651310/extras/8109eaea039ac0f4858589b1d1bc5bb5.avif?t=1772473596\" width=1170 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve included a range of customisation options including cursor size and transparency, audio settings and you can even customise your workspace with a range of backgrounds and mats. Once you\u2019re happy with your design, use the in-game screenshot feature to share your creations with the community and get inspired for your next creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651310/extras/ebe5e1064d2eb1de3c85c81a1c9d3af0.poster.avif?t=1772473596\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651310/extras/ebe5e1064d2eb1de3c85c81a1c9d3af0.webm?t=1772473596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Meteor Pixel"],"dlc":[4146160],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651310/e48142fac9a85480a0d0e28f0e7e97d95817aabc/header.jpg?t=1772473596","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3651310/1002757570/59b5c7cb9c9c7b0436dbd3dfb0d6fa15327a4b67/1763028526/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763029300","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3651310/1002757570/59b5c7cb9c9c7b0436dbd3dfb0d6fa15327a4b67/1763028526/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763029300","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3651310/1002757570/59b5c7cb9c9c7b0436dbd3dfb0d6fa15327a4b67/1763028526/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763029300","id":257230670,"name":"Out Now!","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257230670/d043ae2698278cc46fa7a09c3307d3267d617ccb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763029300"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3651310/1830013225/0388ebc9553eec437ebdb23819c2f7caf9702a29/1753368043/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753369209","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3651310/1830013225/0388ebc9553eec437ebdb23819c2f7caf9702a29/1753368043/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753369209","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3651310/1830013225/0388ebc9553eec437ebdb23819c2f7caf9