equired_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cNot every game needs to be a massive adventure to suck a player in and grab their attention. Little Corners is the perfect example of that. It\u2019s a game I could spend 10 minutes with, or 10 hours.\u201d<br>Vice<br><br>\u201cLittle Corners sticks out as an absolutely adorable peel-and-present sticker-centric sandbox game that feels incredibly satisfying to fill out and captivating to explore.\u201d<br>8.5 \u2013 Gaming<br><br>\u201cThis is the perfect game to play on a cold winter\u2019s day inside under a nice warm blanky.\u201d<br>8.5 \u2013 Game Tyrant<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651310/7047355269eeef724754f1a68fb05846d8cec2b4/ss_7047355269eeef724754f1a68fb05846d8cec2b4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772473596","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651310/7047355269eeef724754f1a68fb05846d8cec2b4/ss_7047355269eeef724754f1a68fb05846d8cec2b4.600x338.jpg?t=1772473596"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651310/3a89b663552394a682b118c18dff1e0e3ad4bfe2/ss_3a89b663552394a682b118c18dff1e0e3ad4bfe2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772473596","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651310/3a89b663552394a682b118c18dff1e0e3ad4bfe2/ss_3a89b663552394a682b118c18dff1e0e3ad4bfe2.600x338.jpg?t=1772473596"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651310/142864a035630c68c66291ead02533ebb61b9e61/ss_142864a035630c68c66291ead02533ebb61b9e61.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772473596","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651310/142864a035630c68c66291ead02533ebb61b9e61/ss_142864a035630c68c66291ead02533ebb61b9e61.600x338.jpg?t=1772473596"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651310/5886dcff5f24e299e89f229b7e7a1d488b9dfcfd/ss_5